WEBVTT

00:00:03.184 --> 00:00:07.754
When a customer calls you, search Contacts for the number with the phone

00:00:07.754 --> 00:00:11.504
term, open the contact, then choose Add Activity, Inbound.

00:00:11.504 --> 00:00:15.664
If the caller is not in the system yet, create the contact first.

00:00:17.409 --> 00:00:21.584
Fill in the subject's fields, add notes and pick the disposition.

00:00:21.584 --> 00:00:26.819
Only the dispositions that the inbound subject's flow has an action for are listed.

00:00:27.689 --> 00:00:33.893
The workflow results show what the disposition does, for example a follow-up call two days later.

00:00:33.893 --> 00:00:38.229
Click Log Activity, and the activity is saved as completed by you.

